# Pairs with ReadPositionHonest, and reproduces the snapshot-load failure path
# production had until issue #4450 was fixed (#4470, LeafReplayStartPolicy now
# fails closed). TryRehydrateFromSnapshotAsync answered an ordinary
# storage fault, a missing segment or an unreadable frame by returning false,
# which the activation could not tell from "no snapshot": it took the -1 cold
# override and replayed the whole READABLE WAL, guarded only by the cold-replay
# trim test against the persisted checkpoint. Under coverage-gated trim the
# readable WAL no longer holds the prefix the snapshot covered, and a tail at
# exactly persisted + 1 passes that test, so the leaf comes up having read past
# acknowledged writes it does not hold. The base fails the activation closed.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestLoadFailureColdReplays
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a snapshot that fails to load is treated as absent and the leaf cold-replays a WAL trimmed under that snapshot's coverage
PERTURBS: ActivateLoadFail
--- FIND
    /\ snapCov[l] # NoSnap \/ SnapshotVanished(l)
    /\ UNCHANGED vars
--- REPLACE
    /\ snapCov[l] # NoSnap
\* MUTATION: production's fall-through to the cold path.
    /\ ~FallsOff(durCp[l])
    /\ up' = [up EXCEPT ![l] = TRUE]
    /\ replayRequested' = [replayRequested EXCEPT ![l] = TRUE]
    /\ cache' = [cache EXCEPT ![l] = {}]
    /\ rp' = [rp EXCEPT ![l] = -1]
    /\ stCp' = [stCp EXCEPT ![l] = durCp[l]]
    /\ anchor' = [anchor EXCEPT ![l] = durCp[l]]
    /\ UNCHANGED walVars
    /\ UNCHANGED <<durCp, clk, cov, snapCov, snapRows, stale>>
    /\ UNCHANGED pinVars
    /\ UNCHANGED faults
--- END
